  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Teacher Excellence Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Egypt):  The new Teacher Excellence Initiative will improve the quality and relevance of teacher preparation in Egyptian public universities so that current and future primary school teachers have enhanced skills to increase student learning. The activity will establish pre-service and in-service teacher education programs at Egyptian public universities that give university students the skills and knowledge to apply practice-based, experiential teaching methods in the classroom. To strengthen national systems, the activity will provide technical assistance to support the Government of Egypt and universities to jointly plan, manage, and adapt teacher education. To achieve these goals, the activity will increase linkages between U.S. and Egyptian universities and utilize technology to enhance teaching and learning.</narrative>
  </description>
